<view class="page"><view class="hero card"><text class="eyebrow">{{today}} · 从今天开始</text><block wx:if="{{activePlan}}"><text class="hero-title">{{activePlan.questionBankName}}</text><text class="hero-copy">计划第 {{activePlan.dayOffset}} 天 · 预计完成 {{activePlan.estimatedFinishDate}}</text></block><block wx:else><text class="hero-title">像背单词一样<br/>刷算法题</text><text class="hero-copy">你还没有启用计划，先选择一套题库开始吧。</text><button class="hero-button" bindtap="createPlan">创建我的斩杀计划</button></block></view><block wx:if="{{activePlan}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">今日新刷</text><text class="muted">按题库顺序</text></view><view class="task-list" wx:if="{{newProblems.length}}"><view class="task card" wx:for="{{newProblems}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openProblem" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-bank-code="{{activePlan.questionBankCode}}" data-task-type="new"><view class="task-index">{{index + 1}}</view><view class="task-info"><text class="task-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="task-meta">{{item.category}} · {{item.difficulty}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="empty card" wx:else><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>今天没有新的刷题安排。</text></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">今日复刷</text><text class="muted">逾期优先</text></view><view class="empty card"><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>暂无到期复习，提交记录会在下一阶段生成复刷安排。</text></view></block><view class="empty card" wx:if="{{!activePlan && !loadingTasks}}"><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>创建计划后，这里会出现每日新刷与复刷任务。</text></view></view>
